  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center MOYE Trainer Training on Farmer&#x2019;s Financial Cycle (FFC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative aims to equip the trainers at the MOYE Center with the necessary skills to effectively train the final beneficiaries - particularly women, youth, and small-scale farmers. The center will be able to enhance its training offering by providing a comprehensive curriculum for its learners, thereby attracting more of them. Finally, the reputation of the Ivorian-Dutch horticultural training center will be all the greater.</narrative>
  </description>
